			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3639161">
									

<p>Well, my canvas was the memetic evolution of a modern legend. SCP-2278 isn't Loreley. Or rather, not only. It's the collective unconscious gestalt surrounding it, made material. So, it's Loreley, and every mermaid, and the Rhine itself. All of that and none of that.</p>
<p>The whale part is mermaids explained as cetacean &quot;songs&quot;, the decay is that of the legend itself, the gold and the red water are the Rhine. All merged together into one anomalous nexus.</p>

